oney to remove however much carbon our shipments created. </span><a href="https://seatopia.fish/pages/climate-commitment"><u>Learn more!</u></a></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7486e63a-eaa9-4e2c-aa90-57053dc37912" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1l8er3w" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1434e31c-8d2c-4bef-b27f-e80385999860" aria-expanded="false" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1gv0lp6"><div data-rid="b7537b06-5ae0-4236-b2b8-ccea22b03f71" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-tlc5ty alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Cancellation Policy</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="07986fed-abd4-4043-8af6-335493033e72" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1yrjwz4"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-cbdd58" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="2c5e1391-8867-45a2-a54b-1376ca9853e6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-y725r4"><div data-rid="fa5a3475-f39d-40b4-b581-ea3141dd544b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1xbfla6 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>PAUSE OR CANCEL ANYTIME - We think you'll love SEATOPIA - your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed. You can pause or cancel anytime.</strong><br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4dc50e7d-971f-4df5-81cc-44b713bb5978" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-n8bjq3" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e4be7e47-37